  "articleHtml": "<main>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.uu0zjdy03m9l\">\n<span>\n     Carl\u2019s Jr. Calories Calculator\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Carl\u2019s Jr. is built around charbroiled burgers, but the nutrition of an order can change dramatically depending on whether you choose a single, double, or triple patty, add bacon or cheese, order fries, or turn the sandwich into a combo.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Use the\n    </span>\n<span>\n     Carl\u2019s Jr. Calories Calculator above\n    </span>\n<span>\n     to compare individual menu items and combine your burger, chicken, sides, sauces, breakfast items, and drinks into one complete nutrition total.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.xb4strmbg5il\">\n<span>\n     Single, Double, or Triple Makes a Big Difference\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Carl\u2019s Jr. offers several signature burgers in multiple patty sizes.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     The Famous Star and Western Bacon Cheeseburger are good examples. Adding another beef patty increases protein, but it also increases calories, total fat, saturated fat, cholesterol, and sodium.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     According to Carl\u2019s Jr.\u2019s current menu:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Single Famous Star:\n    </span>\n<span>\n     about 670 calories\n     <br/>\n</span>\n<span>\n     Double Famous Star:\n    </span>\n<span>\n     about 920 calories\n     <br/>\n</span>\n<span>\n     Triple Famous Star:\n    </span>\n<span>\n     about 1,190 calories\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     The same pattern appears with the Western Bacon Cheeseburger:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Single:\n    </span>\n<span>\n     about 770 calories\n     <br/>\n</span>\n<span>\n     Double:\n    </span>\n<span>\n     about 1,020 calories\n     <br/>\n</span>\n<span>\n     Triple:\n    </span>\n<span>\n     about 1,280 calories\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     If you are comparing burgers, match the exact patty count rather than treating every version as the same sandwich.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.qawiv64no3gp\">\n<span>\n     The Western Bacon Cheeseburger Has More Going On Than Beef and Cheese\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     The Western Bacon Cheeseburger is one of Carl\u2019s Jr.\u2019s signature items because it combines a charbroiled beef patty with bacon, American cheese, crispy onion rings, and BBQ sauce.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Those onion rings and BBQ sauce make its nutrition profile different from a more traditional cheeseburger.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     The bun and BBQ sauce contribute carbohydrates, while bacon, cheese, and beef add protein and fat. The crispy onion rings add another breaded component to the sandwich.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     That is why it is more useful to compare the\n    </span>\n<span>\n     finished burger\n    </span>\n<span>\n     than to judge it only by the number of beef patties.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.v8tbcktrbvu4\">\n<span>\n     Charbroiled and Hand-Breaded Chicken Are Different Choices\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Carl\u2019s Jr. serves both charbroiled and hand-breaded chicken items.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Those preparation methods matter.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     A charbroiled chicken sandwich and a hand-breaded chicken sandwich can contain similar amounts of protein while having very different fat, carbohydrate, calorie, and sodium totals.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Breading contributes additional carbohydrates and fat, while sauces, cheese, bacon, and buns can change the final sandwich further.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     When comparing chicken options, look at:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Protein\n     <br/>\n     Calories\n     <br/>\n     Carbohydrates\n     <br/>\n     Total fat\n     <br/>\n     Sodium\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     rather than assuming all chicken sandwiches have similar nutrition.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.8nb1vaevrsjx\">\n<span>\n     Piece Count Matters for Chicken Tenders\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Chicken tenders are another menu item where serving size needs to match your actual order.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Three tenders and five tenders should be treated as separate servings.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     If you add dipping sauce, fries, or a drink, calculate those separately as well.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     This gives you the nutrition of the meal you actually eat rather than only the chicken portion.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.b75vj4tmfwc\">\n<span>\n     Fries, Onion Rings, and Fried Zucchini Are Not Equal Sides\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Carl\u2019s Jr. offers several fried side options, and switching the side can noticeably change your meal.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Natural-Cut Fries are sold in different sizes, while Onion Rings and Fried Zucchini have their own serving portions and nutrition profiles.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     A side that sounds vegetable-based is not automatically low in calories once it is breaded and fried.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     For the most useful comparison, add the exact side and size to your order.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.183i61z8kay6\">\n<span>\n     A Combo Is More Than the Burger\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Carl\u2019s Jr. combo meals normally pair an entr\u00e9e with fries and a soft drink.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     That is why the official menu often shows\n    </span>\n<span>\n     a calorie range\n    </span>\n<span>\n     rather than one fixed number for a combo. The final total depends partly on the side and beverage size or choice.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     For example:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Burger alone\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     and\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Burger + fries + regular soft drink\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     are two very different nutrition calculations.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Use the meal builder when you want to compare complete orders rather than sandwich calories alone.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.hi3cu9ez08db\">\n<span>\n     Breakfast Has Its Own High-Impact Extras\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Carl\u2019s Jr. also has a substantial breakfast menu with biscuits, burritos, breakfast sandwiches, Hash Rounds, French Toast Dips, and the Breakfast Burger.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Breakfast items often combine several calorie-dense ingredients in one order, such as:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Egg + sausage or bacon + cheese + biscuit or tortilla\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     A side of Hash Rounds or syrup adds another component.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     If you are calculating breakfast, include the side and extras just as you would with a lunch or dinner combo.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.mhww9u18yh82\">\n<span>\n     Sodium Can Climb Before You Add the Side\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Carl\u2019s Jr. is another restaurant where sodium deserves attention separately from calories.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Cheese, bacon, sauces, breading, biscuits, breakfast meats, and seasoned burgers can all contribute sodium.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     For example, some larger burgers and chicken sandwiches contain well over 1,000mg of sodium before fries or another side are included.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Two items with similar calories may therefore have very different sodium totals.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.fhip0s8ro98d\">\n<span>\n     Carl\u2019s Jr. Nutrition Questions\n    </span>\n</h2><div class=\"faq-accordion-container space-y-3 my-6\"><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>How many calories are in a Carl\u2019s Jr. Famous Star?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>How many calories are in a Western Bacon Cheeseburger?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>Does adding another burger patty increase protein?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>Are Carl\u2019s Jr. chicken sandwiches lower in calories than burgers?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>Do Carl\u2019s Jr. combo calories include fries and a drink?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>Is Fried Zucchini a low-calorie side?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details></div>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.suabyb9d9suz\">\n<span>\n     Calculate the Carl\u2019s Jr. Order You Actually Eat\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     For the clearest result, start with the exact burger, chicken item, or breakfast entr\u00e9e. Then add your\n    </span>\n<span>\n     side, sauce, drink, and any dessert\n    </span>\n<span>\n     separately.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     NutritionSolver combines the available values so you can compare complete Carl\u2019s Jr. meals instead of relying on the calorie number for the main sandwich alone.\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n</main>",
  "seoTitle": "Carl\u2019s Jr. Calories Calculator: Nutrition & Macros",
  "seoDescription": "Check Carl\u2019s Jr. calories, protein, carbs, fat, and sodium for Famous Star, Western Bacon Cheeseburgers, chicken, fries, breakfast, sides, and more."
}